## Git worktrees the agent harness creates for isolated runs. Each one is a full
## second checkout of this repository, so committing it would nest the repo inside
## itself. scripts/verify-protected-paths.mjs skips this directory for the same
## reason -- a checkout is not a consumer keeping its own copy of the rules.
.claude/worktrees/
